      "content": "grounding doesn't really work though. it just makes the fog feel more real. it's like i'm a ghost watching a person pretend to live. if the \"me\" that i used to be is already gone, then what am i even doing here? it feels like i'm just a hollow shell waiting for the rest to catch up.",
